**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      REGISTER INITIALIZE SUBROUTINE                                *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE PURPOSE OF THE REGISTER INITIALIZE SUBROUTINE IS TO
*            GUARANTEE THAT THE SWITCH SELECTOR REGISTER, DISCRETE
*            OUTPUT REGISTER, LADDER OUTPUT REGISTER, AND THE LADDER
*            CONVERTER ARE AT THEIR PROPER CONDITION DURING EITHER
*            POWER UP, OR A COMMANDED RECYCLE THROUGH FORCED BEGIN
*            FROM AN RCA-110 INTERRUPT.

* ENTRY      RINIT    ENTERED FROM POWER UP OR FORCED BEGIN

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA

RINIT  STO     777          SAVE HOP RETURN                           B

       CLA     =O777776774
       PIO     026          RESET ALL ICR BITS EXCEPT 1 AND 9         I
       XOR     D.KONS
       PIO     022          SET ICR BITS 1 AND 9                      I

       CLA     D.KONS
       PIO     012          RESET ALL DISCRETE OUTPUT REGISTER BITS   I

       CLA     D.KZRO
       PIO     036          RESET ALL SWITCH SELECTOR REGISTER BITS   I

       PIO     172          CLAMP LADDERS TO ZERO                     I
*      CLA     =O460 
       CLA     =O006
       SUB     D.KB8        DELAY 50 MSEC.                            B
       TNZ     *-1
       PIO     712          CLAMP LADDERS TO ZERO                     I

       CLA     D.KB12
       PIO     022          SET ICR BIT 14 TO SELECT CONVERTER A      I
       
       PIO     023          READ EMR TO CLEAR SCB BIT                 I

       HOP     777          RETURN                                    X
